OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud across Devon and Cornwall
OL,6,Fwill start to lift through the day,
OL,7,Fbringing sunny spells across the
OL,8,Fregion. Slightly warmer than previous
OL,9,Fdays with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry this evening and
OL,12,Fovernight with variable amounts of
OL,13,Fcloud with some clear spells. Cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing from the north later,
OL,15,Fperhaps with an odd shower in the far
OL,16,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
