OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMostly dry, but often
OL,6,Fcloudy. A chance of some rain across
OL,7,Fthe north of the region during the
OL,8,Fmorning and into the early afternoon.
OL,9,FSkies clearing from the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FLargely settled through Thursday and
OL,13,FFriday, with chilly nights and bright,
OL,14,Fsunny days. Temperatures will feel
OL,15,Fwarm in the sunshine. Increasing
OL,16,Fcloudy from Saturday, bringing the
OL,17,Frisk of some rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
